H2807.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:20; 
son of: Zerubbabel (H2216); 
brother of: Meshullam (H4918H), Hananiah (H2608L), Shelomith (H8019I), Ohel (H0169), Berechiah (H1296), Hasadiah (H2619), Jushab-hesed (H3142), Abiud (G0010) 
§ Hashubah = "consideration"
a son of Zerubbabel

H2845.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:15; 
son of: Canaan (H3667); 
brother of: Sidon (H6721), Jebusite (H2983), Amorite (H0567), Girgashite (H1622), Hivite (H2340), Arkite (H6208), Sinite (H5513), Arvadite (H0721), Zemarite (H6786) and Hamathite (H2577); also called Hittite (KJV: "of Heth") frequently
Also named: chit.ti (חִתִּי "Hittite" H2850) 
§ Heth = "terror"
a son of Canaan and the progenitor of the Hittites

H2850.def:
Someone descended from Heth who was a man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:15; 
son of: Canaan (H3667); 
brother of: Sidon (H6721), Jebusite (H2983), Amorite (H0567), Girgashite (H1622), Hivite (H2340), Arkite (H6208), Sinite (H5513), Arvadite (H0721), Zemarite (H6786) and Hamathite (H2577); also called Hittite (KJV: "of Heth") frequently
Group of chet (חֵת "Heth" H2845) 
§ Hittite = "descendant of Heth"
the nation descended from Heth, the 2nd son of Canaan; once inhabitants of central Anatolia (modern Turkey), later in north Lebanon

H2867.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:13; 
son of: Othniel (H6274) whose wife was Achsah (H5915); 
brother of: Meonothai (H4587)(?) 
§ Hathath = "fearful"
son of Othniel and grandson of Kenaz, the brother of Caleb

H2875.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Genèse 22:24; 
son of: Nahor (H5152H) and Reumah (H7208); 
brother of: Gaham (H1514), Tahash (H8477) and Maacah (H4601); 
half-brother of: Uz (H5780H), Buz (H0938), Kemuel (H7055), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044) and Bethuel (H1328A) 
§ Tebah = "a slaughter"
a son of Nahor by his concubine Reumah

H2882.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 26:11; 
son of: Hosah (H2621H); 
brother of: Shimri (H8113I), Hilkiah (H2518J) and Zechariah (H2148F) 
§ Tebaliah = "purified"
the 3rd son of Hosah of the children of Merari and temple gatekeeper

H2886.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Rois 15:18; 
son of: Hezion (H2383); 
father of: Ben-hadad (H1130) 
§ Tabrimon = "good is Rimmon"
the father of Ben-hadad I, king of Syria
